      "finding": "MusicBrainz defines a release group as the logical album-level entity that groups releases, not a publishing group or software version group (https://musicbrainz.org/doc/Release_Group). The Mesh callsite also means network peers; current Hindi, Vietnamese, and Indonesian use generic companions/colleagues instead. Keep the MusicBrainz and Soulseek names unchanged."
